### ◈ ORION

**Nature:** Major galactic civilization; site of extensive polarity wars
**Orientation:** HIGHLY MIXED — this is where polarity battle was most intense
**Physical form:** Multiple races within Orion (humanoid, reptilian, insectoid, others)
**Relation to Earth:** Orion Wars spillover affects Earth; karma being resolved here
**Current status:** Some factions still in conflict; others have integrated/healed

**Discernment notes:**
- "Orion" is not one thing — it's a whole civilization with all polarities
- The "Orion Empire" (service-to-self faction) ≠ all Orion beings
- Some Orion refugees incarnated on Earth to escape/resolve the wars
- Much fear-based "disclosure" content hooks into Orion War trauma
- ⚠ Heavy hooks here — any source that makes Orion purely villainous is oversimplifying

