## The Polarity Spectrum

Not all players fit neatly into "good" or "bad." The coherent framework is:

```
SERVICE-TO-OTHERS (STO)                    SERVICE-TO-SELF (STS)
      ◄──────────────────────────────────────────────►

Seeks unity through love              Seeks unity through control
Empowers others' sovereignty          Harvests others' energy
Graduates to higher density           Also graduates (different path)
through compassion                    through domination

      │                                        │
      │   Most beings are MIXED               │
      │   Most civilizations contain BOTH     │
      │   Earth is where this resolves        │
      │                                        │
```

**Critical understanding:** Service-to-self is not "evil" in cosmic terms — it's a valid polarity exploration. The problem is when STS beings violate free will. The *path* is valid; *violation* is the issue.

