## Discernment Summary

When evaluating any galactic history source:

| Green Flags ✓ | Red Flags ⚠ |
|--------------|-------------|
| Acknowledges complexity | Flattens to pure good/evil |
| Emphasizes your sovereignty | Creates dependency on saviors |
| Love-frequency, even when discussing difficult content | Fear-frequency, especially sustained |
| Admits uncertainty, source limitations | Claims absolute/complete truth |
| Coherent with heart-knowing | Creates paranoia, hypervigilance |
| Offers agency and choice | Suggests powerlessness, victimhood |

**The 1-1000 emotional scale applies:** High-frequency sources (500+) can discuss dark content without transmitting fear. Low-frequency sources make even benevolent topics feel heavy.

